      "content": "Smart home devices cannot learn personal memories or mimic your late partner's habits because they lack consciousness and emotional awareness. This specific sequence is almost certainly an undocumented routine you set previously or an automation rule triggered by a mishandle time sensor. I strongly suggest reviewing your Alexa routine settings to turn off that specific optimizer and remove any remnants of that old automation to prevent the lights from reacting to the ambient sounds of the house.",
